    {
      "name": "dsh-auto-proxy",
      "title": {
        "en": "Local proxy fallback",
        "zh-cn": "本地代理兜底"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Injects one short prompt section: direct access stays the default, and only after a network call actually fails should the agent consider that a local proxy may be running. A companion text file next to the plugin carries proxy addresses that worked on this machine, so one session's discovery is visible to the next.",
        "zh-cn": "注入一段很短的提示词：默认直连，只有请求真的失败后，才提醒 agent「本机可能开着代理」。插件目录下另有一个文本文件，记录这台机器上试通过的代理地址，让一个会话的发现能被下一个会话读到。"
      },
      "icon": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,",
      "repository": {
        "url": "https://github.com/iShawnWang/dsh-market",
        "directory": "plugins/dsh-auto-proxy"
      },
